  "articleBody": "Start by confirming that the garage can legally become habitable space, then develop a code-conscious plan, resolve parking and utility issues, obtain approvals, and complete inspections before using the room as a bedroom. A coordinated design-build process can keep layout decisions, permit documents, construction work, and final inspection connected.",
